+
+- [ ] **Step 1: Write failing test (AC-4)** — with a frozen `now`: a `ready` row renders `formatFreshness(reading.measuredAt, now)`; a `stale` row that still has a `reading` ALSO renders the age; a `brak danych` row (no reading) renders no age line. (Inject `now` via the component if needed, or spy — keep the assertion on the rendered age text.)
