+- [ ] **Step 3: Implement** — in `PlaceRow`, when a `reading` exists (ready or stale), render a dim age line `formatFreshness(reading.measuredAt, new Date())` (consistent with the row subtitle; reuse `colors.text.dim`/`faint`). No age when there's no reading.
+- [ ] **Step 4: Run tests** — green.
+- [ ] **Step 5: Full gate** green, `src/core` 100%. Commit: `feat(miejsca): show data age on rows (AC-4)`.
+
+---
+
+### Task 5: Manual sim verification (AC-5, AC-6) + journal
